{"5001120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bull Run Clicker", "steam_appid": 5001120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Greed is a growth strategy</h2>You start with a paper route. Ten desks later you are operating a central bank money printer, and at no point did anyone stop to ask whether this should be happening.<br><br>Bull Run is an incremental game about the market: its manias, its crashes, and the people who explain them to you afterwards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb the ladder</h2>Paper Route. Lemonade Stand LLC. Intern. Cold-Call Desk. Day Trader. Algo Bot. Quant Team. Hedge Fund. Investment Bank. Central Bank Printer.<br><br>Every desk earns while you sleep. Every desk makes the one before it look quaint.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play the market</h2>Twenty-three tickers, all moving without your permission. Buy low and sell high, or discover the other order. Get in on an IPO before the lockup expires. Accumulate shares in a company until you own it outright, then collect its dividends forever.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the news</h2>138 events roll across the ticker: booms, panics, and headlines written by people who were wrong last week too. HACK MAIL arrives in your inbox. Opening it is a coin flip. Not opening it is also a decision.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cash out</h2>When the numbers get silly, take the golden parachute. Trade a lifetime of earnings for permanent upgrades across 38 skills, then start again from the paper route and get there faster.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's in the box</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 10 desks, from paper route to money printer<br></li><li> 23 tradable stocks, ETFs and commodities<br></li><li> 138 market events and news headlines<br></li><li> 38 permanent skills across a prestige tree<br></li><li> 75 Steam achievements<br></li><li> Steam Cloud saves<br></li><li> Offline earnings, because the desks keep working when you don't</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Greed is a growth strategy</h2>You start with a paper route. Ten desks later you are operating a central bank money printer, and at no point did anyone stop to ask whether this should be happening.<br><br>Bull Run is an incremental game about the market: its manias, its crashes, and the people who explain them to you afterwards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb the ladder</h2>Paper Route. Lemonade Stand LLC. Intern. Cold-Call Desk. Day Trader. Algo Bot. Quant Team. Hedge Fund. Investment Bank. Central Bank Printer.<br><br>Every desk earns while you sleep. Every desk makes the one before it look quaint.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play the market</h2>Twenty-three tickers, all moving without your permission. Buy low and sell high, or discover the other order. Get in on an IPO before the lockup expires. Accumulate shares in a company until you own it outright, then collect its dividends forever.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the news</h2>138 events roll across the ticker: booms, panics, and headlines written by people who were wrong last week too. HACK MAIL arrives in your inbox. Opening it is a coin flip. Not opening it is also a decision.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cash out</h2>When the numbers get silly, take the golden parachute. Trade a lifetime of earnings for permanent upgrades across 38 skills, then start again from the paper route and get there faster.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's in the box</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 10 desks, from paper route to money printer<br></li><li> 23 tradable stocks, ETFs and commodities<br></li><li> 138 market events and news headlines<br></li><li> 38 permanent skills across a prestige tree<br></li><li> 75 Steam achievements<br></li><li> Steam Cloud saves<br></li><li> Offline earnings, because the desks keep working when you don't</li></ul>", "short_description": "Start with a paper route. End with a central bank money printer. Click, trade and leverage your way up ten desks of Wall Street, survive rug pulls and hostile takeovers, 